  "FAQ": [
    {
      "question": "What material information is confirmed?",
      "answer": "The source identifies an EVA shoe body and upper. The orange pod, separate midsole, lining and insole compositions are not specified. Send specific material requirements with your inquiry for order-specific confirmation."
    },
    {
      "question": "Which colors and size groups can I request?",
      "answer": "Red and Grey are offered. Original source labels are 35-36, 37-38, 39-40, 40-41, 42-43 and 44-45. Specify quantities for each color and original size group. Fit, measurements and international size conversion are confirmed for the order."
    },
    {
      "question": "What do the photos show?",
      "answer": "Actual source images show a closed toe, open heel, ribbed sides, textured vamp panel and separate orange sole pods. The Black underside detail is for structure only; Black is not offered. No tested grip, massage, cushioning or rebound performance is claimed."
    },
    {
      "question": "What are the minimum and quantity prices?",
      "answer": "The listing minimum is 2 pairs. Indicative unit prices are USD 10.08 for 2-49 pairs, USD 9.41 for 50-99 pairs and USD 8.74 for 100 or more pairs. Final quotation depends on quantities, color-size mix, packing, destination and agreed terms; freight and taxes are confirmed separately."
    },
    {
      "question": "Can I request samples or customized packing?",
      "answer": "Send your sample quantity, requested colors and any logo or packing requirements. Feasibility, applicable minimums, sample charges and available customization options are assessed before quotation."
    },
    {
      "question": "Are stock and dispatch guaranteed?",
      "answer": "No ready-stock or fixed dispatch promise is made. Provide quantities, destination, packing and requested dispatch date. Supply, per-size availability, payment terms and dispatch arrangements are confirmed during inquiry."
    }
